{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19090","headline":"送分司陈郎中秖召直史馆重修三圣实録 · 刘禹锡","name":"送分司陈郎中秖召直史馆重修三圣实録","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉鸣官树引行车，言自成周赴玉除。\n远取南朝贵公子，重修东观帝王书。\n常时载笔窥金匮，暇日登楼到石渠。\n若问旧人刘子政，如今白首在南徐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}